; TwoToTango real motor data — from prs2026/TwoToTango/Sim Files/thrust curves/
; Sources: Walter_J360.eng, walterlongmotorbetter.eng, N3114RR.eng, motor file.eng
;
; NOTE on J495AP(NC): No J495AP.eng exists in the repo — the sustainer motor
;   is only stored in .ric (RASAero proprietary) files that cannot be parsed.
;   J446 (Polaris, 38mm) from motor file.eng is used as the best available proxy
;   (same manufacturer family, similar thrust range).  This affects twototango
;   and waltz predictions.  All other motors are the real measured curves.

